## 취약점 PoC 결과 요약 — libtiff/tif_predict.c

| # | 취약점 | 함수 | 상태 |
|---|--------|------|------|
| VULN 001 | Heap Buffer Overflow via non-multiple-of-8 BitsPerSample (Floating-Point Predictor) | `fpAcc()` (L352–383) | **VERIFIED_CRASH** |
| VULN 002 | Heap OOB Read via non-multiple-of-8 BitsPerSample (Floating-Point Predictor) | `fpDiff()` (L517–548) | **SKIPPED** |

